<Definition classid="UserCmpDefn" name="pgb" url="" view="false" instances="0" date="0" crc="30504329" id="593688325" group="I/O Devices"><paramlist><param name="Description" value="Output Channel" /></paramlist><form name="Output Channel" w="320" h="420" splitter="70" commentlines="4"><category name="Configuration" visible="true"><cond /><parameter type="Text" name="Name" desc="Title" helpmode="Overwrite" group="" allowemptystr="false"><value>Value</value><help>Title is used for display on plots, meters,... </help><cond type="Enable">UseSignalName==0</cond><regex /><error_msg /></parameter><parameter type="Text" name="Group" desc="Group" group="" helpmode="Overwrite" allowemptystr="false"><value /><cond type="Enable" /><help>Enter the name of the Runtime Object Group, to which this component is to belong (default is blank).</help><regex /><error_msg /></parameter><parameter desc="Use Signal Name as Title?" name="UseSignalName" group="" type="Choice" helpmode="Overwrite" animate="false"><value>1</value><cond type="Enable" /><help>If enabled, the output channel will assume the name of the signal, to which it is connected. The signal name is generic and is assigned by the upon compilation of the module. Note that if left enabled, the output channel name will continue to dynamically change with the signal name.</help><choice>0 = No</choice><choice>1 = Yes</choice></parameter><parameter desc="Transfer Data?" name="enab" group="" type="Choice" helpmode="Overwrite" animate="false"><value>1</value><cond type="Enable" /><help>Enable or disable the transfer of plotting data between EMTDC and PSCAD. If No is selected, this output channel will not request data transfer from EMTDC. Disabling helps to reduce redundant memory usage during runtime. It will still be saved if recording output files, although on-line plotting is disabled.</help><choice>0 = No</choice><choice>1 = Yes</choice></parameter><parameter type="Choice" name="Display" desc="Display Title on Icon?" group="" helpmode="Overwrite" animate="false"><value>1</value><cond type="Enable" /><help>Select Yes or No to display the Title directly on the component graphic.</help><choice>0 = No</choice><choice>1 = Yes</choice></parameter><parameter type="Real" name="Scale" desc="Scale Factor" content_type="Literal" min="-1E+308" max="1E+308" unit="" group="" helpmode="Overwrite" intent="Input" dim="1" animate="false"><value>1.0</value><cond type="Enable" /><help>The input is multiplied by this value before it is recorded.</help></parameter><parameter type="Text" name="Units" desc="Unit" helpmode="Overwrite" group="" allowemptystr="true"><value /><help>Unit is used for display on plots and meters: pu,kA,... </help><cond type="Enable" /><regex /><error_msg /></parameter><parameter type="Choice" name="mrun" desc="Multiple Run Save" group="" helpmode="Overwrite" animate="false"><value>0</value><cond type="Enable" /><help>Save output during multiple run for each run or only the last run.</help><choice>0 = Last run only</choice><choice>1 = All runs</choice></parameter><parameter type="Choice" name="Pol" desc="Is Input in Polar Form?" group="" helpmode="Overwrite" animate="false"><value>0</value><cond type="Enable" /><help>Paired array with an even dimension (i.e. 2, 4, 6, etc.) Scaling is applied only to the odd elements.</help><choice>0 = No</choice><choice>1 = Yes</choice></parameter><parameter type="Real" name="Max" desc="Default Maximum Display Limit" content_type="Literal" min="-1E+308" max="1E+308" unit="" group="" helpmode="Overwrite" intent="Input" dim="1" animate="false"><value>2.0</value><cond type="Enable" /><help>Enter a value to control the maximum display limit on devices.</help></parameter><parameter type="Real" name="Min" desc="Default Minimum Display Limit" content_type="Literal" min="-1E+308" max="1E+308" unit="" group="" helpmode="Overwrite" intent="Input" dim="1" animate="false"><value>-2.0</value><cond type="Enable" /><help>Enter a value to control the minimum display limit on devices</help></parameter></category></form><svg viewBox="-200 -200 200 200"><paramlist><param name="show_grid" value="0" /><param name="size" value="0" /><param name="orient" value="1" /><param name="show_border" value="0" /></paramlist><port model="Transfer" name="Signl" x="0" y="0" dim="0" mode="Input" type="Real" internal="false">true</port><cond>enab != 1</cond><rect x="10" y="-16" width="24" height="22" stroke="Red" stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-width="0.2" fill-style="Solid" fill-fg="Red" fill-bg="Transparent" /><cond>true</cond><rect x="10" y="-16" width="24" height="22" stroke="Silver" stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-width="0.6" fill-style="Hollow" fill-fg="Black" fill-bg="Transparent" /><line x1="0" y1="0" x2="10" y2="0" stroke="Black" stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-width="0.2" /><line x1="6" y1="-4" x2="10" y2="0" stroke="Black" stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-width="0.2" /><line x1="10" y1="0" x2="6" y2="4" stroke="Black" stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-width="0.2" /><line x1="15" y1="-12" x2="15" y2="1" stroke="Navy" stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-width="0.2" /><line x1="13" y1="0" x2="28" y2="0" stroke="Navy" stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-width="0.2" /><line x1="15" y1="0" x2="19" y2="-7" stroke="Black" stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-width="0.2" /><line x1="19" y1="-7" x2="22" y2="-4" stroke="Black" stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-width="0.2" /><line x1="25" y1="-7" x2="22" y2="-4" stroke="Black" stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-width="0.2" /><line x1="28" y1="-7" x2="25" y2="-7" stroke="Black" stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-width="0.2" /><cond>(mrun==1)</cond><line x1="15" y1="-4" x2="19" y2="-12" stroke="Black" stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-width="0.2" /><line x1="19" y1="-12" x2="22" y2="-9" stroke="Black" stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-width="0.2" /><line x1="25" y1="-12" x2="22" y2="-9" stroke="Black" stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-width="0.2" /><line x1="28" y1="-12" x2="25" y2="-12" stroke="Black" stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-width="0.2" /><cond>Scale != 1.0</cond><rect x="10" y="3" width="3" height="3" stroke="Green" stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-width="0.2" fill-style="Solid" fill-fg="Green" fill-bg="" /><cond>(Display==1)</cond><text x="10" y="16" stroke="Black" fill="Black" font-size="Small" text-anchor="Start">%Name</text></svg><script><segment name="Fortran" id="2081319871" classid="CoreSegment">#PGB $dim
#IF dim&gt;1
   #LOCAL INTEGER IVD1_1
#ENDIF

#IF dim==1
   #IF Scale!=1
      PGB(IPGB+$index) = $Scale * $Signl
   #ELSE
      PGB(IPGB+$index) = $Signl
   #ENDIF
#ELSE
   #IF Scale!=1
    #IF (ceil(0.5*dim)==floor(0.5*dim))&amp;&amp;(Pol==1)
      DO IVD1_1 = 1, $dim, 2
         PGB(IPGB+$index+IVD1_1-1) = $Scale * $Signl(IVD1_1)
         PGB(IPGB+$index+IVD1_1)   = $Signl(IVD1_1+1) 
    #ELSE
      DO IVD1_1 = 1, $dim
         PGB(IPGB+$index+IVD1_1-1) = $Scale * $Signl(IVD1_1)
    #ENDIF
   #ELSE
      DO IVD1_1 = 1, $dim
         PGB(IPGB+$index+IVD1_1-1) = $Signl(IVD1_1)
   #ENDIF
      ENDDO
#ENDIF
